        "Gets the direction right and quantifies it: β_D = 0 understates β_U (1.1400), r_U (8.7000%) and the WACC (8.5600%) by 0.0060 and overvalues the division by NOK 45.9127 million, about 7.0%. Saying the shortcut undervalues the firm is a conceptual error, not a rounding one.",
